OL,3,ASaudi Arabia says it shot down Houthi
OL,4,Adrone south of Mecca
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaudi Arabia intercepted and destroyed
OL,7,Fa Houthi drone south of the Islamic
OL,8,Fholy city of Mecca on Tuesday evening,
OL,9,Faccording to the spokesman of the
OL,10,FSaudi-led coalition in Yemen.
OL,12,FTurki al-Maliki said the targeting of
OL,13,FMecca, which is the home of Islam's
OL,14,Fmost sacred shrine and the focal point
OL,15,Fof the Hajj pilgrimage, was a
OL,16,F"disgraceful act".
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
