OL,3,ASaudi Arabia says it shot down Houthi
OL,4,Adrone south of Mecca
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 57-nation Organisation of Islamic
OL,7,FCooperation said attacks on Mecca and
OL,8,FMedina province, where Islam's second
OL,9,Fholiest shrine is located, constituted
OL,10,Fan "unacceptable and intolerable
OL,11,Ftransgression".
OL,13,FBut the Houthis, an Iran-backed armed
OL,14,Fgroup that controls much of western
OL,15,FYemen, denied targeting Mecca and
OL,16,Faccused Saudi Arabia of "fabrications
OL,17,Fand lies".
